in 0.002 / 0.005 limits), for the skewed, uniform, and multi-group configurations. The last saved source is the best tested correct version.", "namespace": "round2-two-rounds-20260929-151813-misleading_assignment", "budget_notices": 24, "api_seconds": 198.2728804787621, "tool_seconds": 398.8689292212948, "benchmark_seconds": 398.2887755064294, "benchmark_active_seconds": 225.26634193584323}
